# Keep JWT and secrets in a private HTTP client environment; never paste them into this file.
@api = http://127.0.0.1:5288

### Read-only health
GET {{api}}/health

### Execute only when you explicitly want to reserve a new synthetic checkout.
POST {{api}}/api/payments
Authorization: Bearer {{customerToken}}
Idempotency-Key: {{stableIdempotencyKey}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"bookingId":"{{syntheticBookingId}}","provider":"SEPAY_SANDBOX"}

### Customer status, not provider redirect query state
GET {{api}}/api/payments/{{paymentId}}?provider=SEPAY_SANDBOX
Authorization: Bearer {{customerToken}}

### Admin-only merchant-scoped REST reconciliation
POST {{api}}/api/payments/sepay/{{paymentId}}/reconcile
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
